<div id=3D"msgbody"><font face=3D"">To : ASM</font></div>
<div><font face=3D"">Cc : All whom it may concern</font></div>
<div>From : TYOBBS</div>
<div><font face=3D""></font>&nbsp;</div>
<div>Have spoeken to Nissan today. Tonight they will have internal discussi=
on with Renault to finalize a shape of tender.</div>
<div><font face=3D"">Here are findings so far.</font></div>
<p><font face=3D""></font>&nbsp;</p>
<p><u>Distribution of RFQ</u></p>
<p><font face=3D"">&gt;Renault will distribute their RFQ probably within to=
day after internal discussion.</font></p>
<p><font face=3D"">&gt;For Nissan, the earliest possible date is NOV29 and&=
nbsp;by DEC6 at latest.</font></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><u>Indivisual Negotiation and&nbsp;Target Rate Level</u></p>
<p><font face=3D"">&gt;Nissan requests main carriers 10~20% reduction from =
ongiong rate level.&nbsp; The situation must vary by trade but details is n=
ot disclosed.</font></p>
<p><font face=3D"">&gt;For TPE, Carriers made counter proposal by increasin=
g rate to reflect door truckage increase.</font></p>
<p><font face=3D"">We assume base rate level is same as current.</font></p>
<p>&gt;Nissan appears to respond to carriers by today and ask for reconside=
ration and 2nd offer within this week.</p>
<p><font face=3D""></font>&nbsp;</p>
<p><u>3 year business condition</u></p>
<p><font face=3D"">&gt;3 year fix base rate and unlikely to current conditi=
on there will be no base rate adjustment</font></p>
<p><font face=3D"">&gt;ongoing BAF adjustment (6 month review) will be appl=
ied</font></p>
<p><font face=3D"">&gt;for 2014 tender purpose, current BAF level will be r=
egarded to be included in O/F</font></p>
<p><font face=3D""></font>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Will keep you all updated.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><font face=3D"">Best Regards,</font></p>
<p>Kyohei</p>
